@host = http://localhost:5161

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Log in (seeded accounts are listed in api/README.md)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "universityId": "I1001",
  "password": "UniCheck@2026"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
